---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const pageTitle = "About";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
  <p>
    Hello, <a href="https://www.github.com/lemon4sour">SourLemon</a> here!
  </p>
  <p>
    Thanks for checking out our website. Hopefully by reading our posts you'll
    be more aware when using the web in the future!
  </p>
  <p>
    Before we talk about ourselves, I need to give some background information
    first. This project initially started as an idea inspired by Rolimon's.
    Rolimon's is a Roblox trading community (<abbr title="Let's Make a Deal"
      >LMaD</abbr
    >) meant to house people who are interested in exchanging their limited
    edition digital accessories. Real money is involved in stuff like this, and
    as such, these types of communities are prone to getting their accounts
    compromised, or worse.
  </p>
  <p>
    As such, one of the members of the Rolimon's staff made a forum channel for
    documenting some of the scam methods. This eventually got spread to other
    Roblox community Discord servers. This made it increasingly harder to update
    each channel. Around the same time, I was learning how to build pages using
    Astro, which gave me the idea to make a web page dedicated to online
    security, and have our friend from Rolimon's be a part of it.
  </p>
  <p>
    In the future, I aim to make this website a place where <strong
      >anyone</strong
    > can document threats found online.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
